    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d175">

                <pb facs="0294" n="196" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg196"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">511.3B1/1: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Commission to Negotiate Peace</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-01T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 1,
                                1919—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3293. Your 4198, September 13th, midnight.<anchor n="56" xml:id="d175-f1"/></p>
                <p>French Embassy states it has information that American military authorities have
                    disposed of arms or munitions to Spain, contrary to understanding expressed in
                        protocol.<anchor n="57" xml:id="d175-f2"/></p>
                <pb facs="0295" n="197" xml:id="pg197"/>
                <p>Please advise American military authorities and place text of Convention and
                    protocol at their disposal.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
